      "message": "feat(contour): Start point and Exit point rows on the Lead tab\n\nThe closed 2D contour's user-set start and exit points (#1478, #1492)\nhad no door in the GUI. The contour's \"Lead in / Lead out\" tab now has\ntwo optional groups, \"Start point\" and \"Exit point\", each switched on\nin its header with X and Y rows in model coordinates. Off writes None\n(the automatic seam); on seeds the origin. The rows edit the draft and\nApply commits them through EditOperationParams, so undo and redo\nrestore the earlier point. Other kinds draw neither group.\n\nTyped coordinates only; the viewport pick stays owed in #1473.\n\nRefs #1448\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
